-1 MISTCITY_CHANGES~
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that caused [*****] BUG: Mpforce - Forcing oneself: vnum 10902.
           The line was - mpat chango mpforce chango mpgoto 10715
           Changed to   - Removed chango as a short desc for chango's wife. (Order)
