-1 MISTCITYMAP~
This City is the second area in the Isle of Mist trilogy, which consists
of The Isle of Mist, Mist City, and King Menos' Maze.  This area was created 
by Presto 8-24-94 and is centered on the Isle of Mist.  A map of the city
is located in the area.

   (-) Back

{-}PRESTO
~
