#10909
glorius~
Glorius~
Glorius is here, awaiting her execution.~
Glorius looks so young, and beautiful.  You wonder what she did to
deserve death.  It might be rude to ask, "What did you do?"  But since
she's chained to the wall, I guess it wouldn't hurt anything.~
