AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
1 0 0 1d1+7 1d1+3
0 10
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
mpforce $n external IMSTUCK.WAV
~
>speech_prog p What did you do?~
say I escaped from King Menos' maze.
say Would you like to help me escape from here?
~
>speech_prog sure yes ok~
say The executioner has the keys to the shackles I'm wearing.
~
>give_prog i10923~
say Thanks!
mpjunk i10923
emote unlocks the shackles.
say At last I am FREE!
cackle
mpecho Before your eyes, Glorius morphs into a Mist Dragon!
mpmload 10917
mpgoto 2
suicide
~
